Package: treediffr
Title: Structured Data Tree Diff
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gerry", "Campion", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gerrycampion@gmail.com")
Description: Compare JSON, XML, and CSV structures recursively and report
    additions, removals, replacements, and moves with format-aware paths.
